sn42.11:3.5 | S: ‘All the suffering that arises is rooted and sourced in desire. | T: All of it has desire as its root, has desire as its cause—
sn42.11:3.6 | S: For desire is the root of suffering.’ | T: for desire is the cause of stress.”
