an3.61:1.6 | S: ‘Everything this individual person experiences—pleasurable, painful, or neutral—is because of God Almighty’s creation.’ | T: ‘Whatever a person experiences—pleasant, painful, or neither pleasant nor painful—is all caused by a supreme being’s act of creation.’
